Encoder and Embedding Models

    >   The Encoder model turns text into a vector Embedding. This is then stored in a vector Database in Chroma.
    >   Chroma -> It's an Open Source Vector DB.
    > Few Embedding Models:
        1.  Word2Vec
        2.  BERT
        3.  OpenAI -> text-embedding-3-small, text-embedding-3-large
        4.  Google -> gemini-embedding-001
        5.  HuggingFace sentence transformer -> all-MiniLM-L6-v2